Step 1: neutrosophic triples of the four courses and their betting intervals [T, 1 - F]
course (T, I, F)           T+I+F       interval  width stated I
DE     (0.5, 0.1, 0.2)       0.8 [0.5, 0.8]        0.3      0.1
SA     (0.6, 0.2, 0.4)       1.2 [0.6, 0.6]        0.0      0.2
FM     (0.8, 0.0, 0.1)       0.9 [0.8, 0.9]        0.1      0.0
